referenceSystem — licence
=========================

SCOPE OF THIS LICENCE
---------------------

The MIT licence below covers the code and documentation written for this
toolbox: the MATLAB package `+referenceSystem/`, the C sources at the top of
`mex/` (`rsCore.c`, `rsApi.c`, `mexGateway.c` and their headers), the test
suite under `test/`, the build and audit scripts, and the written
documentation.

IT DOES NOT COVER THE THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE AND DATA DISTRIBUTED WITH IT.
Those carry their own terms and are listed, with their licences, in
`THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`. In particular `mex/sofa/` (IAU SOFA) and
`mex/iers/` (IERS Conventions software) are NOT licensed under the terms
below, and nothing here grants any right in them. Where the two differ, the
third-party terms govern that component.


