A NOTE ON ACCURACY, WHICH THE WARRANTY DISCLAIMER ABOVE DOES NOT REPLACE
------------------------------------------------------------------------

This toolbox is used for satellite geodesy, where a wrong answer is smooth,
plausible and orthogonal to nothing. The accuracy claims it makes are stated
with their evidence in `doc/referenceSystem_accuracy.html` and in each
function's own ACCURACY block, and the boundaries of what has been validated
are recorded in `HANDOVER_referenceSystem.md`. Read those before relying on a
figure; they say what was measured, against which authority, and what was not.
